# Windows batch files must keep CRLF line endings in the stored blob.
# cmd.exe can fail to resolve `goto :label` / `call :label` in a file with
# LF-only endings, and these scripts are downloaded straight from GitHub
# raw URLs, which serve the blob as-is. `-text` disables normalization so
# the CRLF bytes committed here survive to the download.
*.bat -text
